Build standalone

Android
1-incrementar app.json/android/versionCode
2-ENV_PATH=.env.production expo build:android -t apk --release-channel production-v1

IOS
1-incrementar app.json/ios/buildNumber
2-ENV_PATH=.env.production expo build:ios -t archive --release-channel production-v1



